OL,3,GNEWSADon't suffer in silence, urges
OL,4,Amodern slavery survivor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA modern slavery survivor has urged
OL,7,Fother victims of exploitation "not to
OL,8,Fsuffer in silence" as a conference was
OL,9,Fheld to share best practice for
OL,10,Ftackling the crimes and learning how to
OL,11,Fspot the signs of abuse.
OL,13,FThe event, held in Chorley, Lancashire,
OL,14,Fbrought together about 90
OL,15,Frepresentatives from public services,
OL,16,Fcharities and businesses.
OL,18,FModern slavery can involve people being
OL,19,Fthreatened, controlled or deceived into
OL,20,Fwork, criminal activity or sexual
OL,21,Fexploitation.
